# the same-samples check (tools/same_samples.py): the arp on the progression page at Snap 80: ARP tapped on over a
# chord (Up at 90 BPM in eighths), the next chord, then ARP held: Pattern to Up-down 2 octaves, Division to sixteenths,
# Length longer; a rest (F3 held) stops it, its tails ringing; on P3 FELT its triangle; ARP off. Not a test of its own.
notips
tap PLAY
wait 1500
tap HOME
turn ALGO 80
wait 600
wav arp.wav
tapkey 0
wait 1000
tap ARP
wait 300
shot arp-on.png
wait 2700
tapkey 0
wait 3000
press ARP
turn K3 4
wait 300
shot arp-pattern.png
turn K2 2
turn K4 15
release ARP
wait 4000
key 0 down
wait 2000
key 0 up
wait 3000
turn PRESET 2
wait 9000
tap ARP
wait 2500
wavstop
